<title>USA: Union Pacific completes Southern Pacific merger.</title>
<headline>Union Pacific completes Southern Pacific merger.</headline>
<dateline>BETHLEHEM, Pa. 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Pacific Corp said Wednesday it has completed the necessary filings and transactions to finalize its merger with Southern Pacific Rail Corp.</p>
<p>The company said the two railroads will start to combine administrative functions shortly, with total implementation, including the merger of operations, taking at least two years.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
